{"des":"demo1005_4","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_132"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"scaleX":1.36,"scaleY":1.36,"layer":"bg","mirrow":false,"trans":false,"x":-25,"noOut":false,"y":-7.6400000000001,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"img":"bgNew","alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1.36,"scaleY":1.36,"nonStandBright":false,"layer":"bg","mirrow":false,"trans":false,"x":-25,"noOut":false,"y":-7.6400000000001,"timeBak":300,"noIn":false,"transTime":0,"bright":1,"img":"bgNew","alpha":0}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【史学者巴妲】","text":"[show]啊，是克里斯汀来的工匠。[r]石阵的状况如何……？有什么别的发现吗？[l]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_154","text":"那些石头被角布林摧毁了。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_154"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【史学者巴妲】","text":"[cm][show]啊……我们伟大的旧日之神留下的这些遗物，竟然被一群野兽……[r]那这座石阵和这位克里斯汀来的匠人，竟然没有任何关系吗？[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_155"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":257,"noOut":false,"y":-422,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"img":"chara012_0","alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":257,"noOut":false,"y":-422,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":1,"img":"chara012_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【沃夫加】","text":"[show]嗯哼。也许应该叫石门吧——至少，我们把它拼回去了。[r]对吧，契约主？[l]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_156","text":"没错。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_156"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":257,"noOut":false,"y":-422,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"chara012_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【史学者巴妲】","text":"[cm][show]啊……没错，它的确是一扇门……旧神会感谢你们的贡献。[r]但看来这位工匠……这位契约主仍非预言所示之人……唉……[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_157"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":257,"noOut":false,"y":-422,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"chara012_0","alpha":0}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":0,"noOut":false,"y":-489,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"img":"chara015_0","alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":0,"noOut":false,"y":-489,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":1,"img":"chara015_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【芭杜尔】","text":"[show]方便的话，能告诉我们那些石阵，您为什么这么在意吗……？[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_158"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":0,"noOut":false,"y":-489,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"chara015_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【史学者巴妲】","text":"[show]嗯……你们并非神选之人，契约书之外的事情，我无可奉告。[r]任务的事，我会向艾尔莎回复的。[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_159"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":0,"noOut":false,"y":-489,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"chara015_0","alpha":0}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【史学者巴妲】","text":"[show]那么，失陪。愿伟大的旧神能引领你们度过末日。[r]（走路声）[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_160"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":fa